ered:p002","text":"四年，加侍中。五年，遷尚書右僕射，侍中如故。大同三年，以疾陳解，徙為右光祿大夫，給親信二十人。其年，出為雲麾將軍、吳郡太守。先是，何敬容居郡有美績，世稱為何吳郡。及舉為政，聲跡略相比。六年，入為侍中、中書監，未拜，遷太子詹事、翊左將軍，侍中如故。舉父瀹，齊世終此官，累表乞改授，敕不許，久之方就職。九年，遷尚書僕射，侍中、將軍如故。舉雖居端揆，未嘗肯預時務，多因疾陳解。敕輒賜假，並手敕處方，加給上藥。其恩遇如此。其年，以本官參掌選事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0001","kind":"person","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"何敬容","person_id":"rw6_c00_bk5_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"he_jingrong"},{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0002","kind":"person","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"何吳郡","person_id":"rw6_c00_bk5_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"he_jingrong"},{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0003","kind":"person","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"舉","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xie_ju"},{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0004","kind":"person","start":123,"end":124,"surface":"舉","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xie_ju"},{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0005","kind":"person","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"瀹","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xie_yue"},{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p002:m0006","kind":"person","start":166,"end":167,"surface":"舉","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABACB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"xie_ju"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered","book_id":"b-liangshu-037","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-current-rendered"},{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-rendered:p003","text":"何敬容，字國禮，廬江人也。祖攸之，宋太常卿；父昌珝，齊吏部尚書；並有名前代。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-037-xieju-hejingrong-kin-ren